License for Anthropic Serif CJK Rebuild
======================================

This repository ships exactly ONE font binary: fonts/
SerifCJKExtension-Standard.ttf (the cjk preset production build,
added 2026-11-24). The licence information below describes (a) the
repository material, (b) that one binary, and (c) the font software
that you may generate locally from it.

